   "script": "Route118_EventScript_15108F",
   "texts": {
    "Route118_Text_1BDFF4": "The aroma of flowers has a magical\\npower. It cleanses us body and soul.$",
    "Route118_Text_1BE03C": "Oh, dear me.\\nI seem to have lost.$",
    "Route118_Text_1BE05E": "Flowers, POKéMON...\\nI love whatever smells nice.\\pStinky things...\\nI'll pass.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 15,
   "x": 14,
   "y": 14,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_FISHERMAN",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN",
   "range": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NORMAL",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route118_EventScript_1510E4",
   "texts": {
    "Route118_Text_1BE318": "For FISHERMEN, equipment is the key.\\pBut for TRAINERS, the key ingredients\\nare POKéMON and heart, of course!$",
    "Route118_Text_1BE385": "I was beaten in heart?$",
    "Route118_Text_1BE39C": "Come to think of it, fishing is a battle\\nbetween a FISHERMAN and a POKéMON.$"
   },
   "complex": true
  },
  {
   "local_id": 16,
   "x": 56,
   "y": 7,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_MAN_6",
